{"strongs": "H5139", "word": "נָזִיר", "translit": "na.zir", "root": "נזיר", "morph": "N:N--TG", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "one consecrated, devoted", "definition": "נָזִיר noun masculine Gen 49:26 one consecrated, devoted ( ׳ נזיר י (of Samuel); compare Syriac RS Semitic i. 463,2d ed. 483 ); — ׳ נ absolute Num 6:2 + 5 t.; construct נְזִיר Gen 49:26 + 4 t.; suffix נְזִירֶ֑ךְ Lev 25:5 plural נְזִרִים Amos 2:11 ; Amos 2:12 suffix נְוִדֶיהָ Lev 25:11 , נְזִירֶיהָ Lam 4:7 — 1. of prince, ruler, as consecrated: נְזִיר אֶחָיו Lam 49:26 (poem in J ), one consecrated among his brethren , = Deut 33:16 compare נְזִירֶיהָ Lam 4:7 her princes. 2. specifically of one dedicated to ׳ י by vow involving abstinence from intoxicants, from touching corpse, and from cutting hair (compare נֵזֶר 2 ), devotee ( GFM ), Nazirite: אֱלּהִים ׳ נ God's devotee , of Samson Judg 13:5 ; Judg 13:7 ; Judg 16:17 (exceptionally, from birth); usually voluntary Amos 2:11 ; Amos 2:12 , and for limited time, compare ׳ נֶדֶר נ Num 6:2 (of man or woman; compare Peritz JBL xvii (1898), 128 ), ׳ תּוֺרַת נ v Num 6:13 v Num 6:21 , also v Num 6:18 v Num 6:19 v Num 6:20 (all P ; compare also נֵזֶר ). — On Naz. see GFM Judg 13:5 Dr Amos 2:11 , especially Grill JPTh. 1880, 645-680 Now Archaeology ii, § 97 Benz Archaeology 429 f. Gray JThs. Jan. 1900, 201 ff. 3. = untrimmed vine (like Nazirite with unshorn hair) Lev 25:5 ; Lev 25:11 ( H P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5103')\">BDB5103</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5139')\">H5139</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5102')\">BDB5102</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5104')\">BDB5104</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נָזִיר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 49:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,26)\">Gen 49:26</ref></sup> <highlightword>one consecrated, devoted</highlightword> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נזיר י</bdbheb> <wrongReferenceRemoved/> (of Samuel); compare Syriac <placeholder3262/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup>Semitic i. 463,2d ed. 483</sup></lookup>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Num 6:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,2)\">Num 6:2</ref> + 5 t.; construct <bdbheb>נְזִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,26)\">Gen 49:26</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>נְזִירֶ֑ךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,5)\">Lev 25:5</ref> plural <bdbheb>נְזִרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 2:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,11)\">Amos 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,12)\">Amos 2:12</ref> suffix <bdbheb>נְוִדֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,11)\">Lev 25:11</ref>, <bdbheb>נְזִירֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:7\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,7)\">Lam 4:7</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> of prince, ruler, as <highlight>consecrated:</highlight> <bdbheb>נְזִיר אֶחָיו</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Lam 49:26\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(25,49,26)\">Lam 49:26</ref> (poem in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <highlight>one consecrated among his brethren</highlight>, = <ref ref=\"Deut 33:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,16)\">Deut 33:16</ref> compare <bdbheb>נְזִירֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:7\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,7)\">Lam 4:7</ref> <highlight>her princes.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> specifically <highlightword>of one dedicated to</highlightword> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> by vow involving abstinence from intoxicants, from touching corpse, and from cutting hair (compare <bdbheb>נֵזֶר</bdbheb> <b>2</b>), <highlight>devotee</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup>), <highlight>Nazirite:</highlight> <bdbheb>אֱלּהִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <highlight>God's devotee</highlight>, of Samson <ref ref=\"Judg 13:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,5)\">Judg 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,7)\">Judg 13:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,17)\">Judg 16:17</ref> (exceptionally, from birth); usually voluntary <ref ref=\"Amos 2:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,11)\">Amos 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 2:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,12)\">Amos 2:12</ref>, and for limited time, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֶדֶר נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 6:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,2)\">Num 6:2</ref> (of man or woman; compare Peritz<sup>JBL xvii (1898), 128</sup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תּוֺרַת נ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 6:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,13)\">Num 6:13</ref> v<ref ref=\"Num 6:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,21)\">Num 6:21</ref>, also v<ref ref=\"Num 6:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,18)\">Num 6:18</ref> v<ref ref=\"Num 6:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,19)\">Num 6:19</ref> v<ref ref=\"Num 6:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,20)\">Num 6:20</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; compare also <bdbheb>נֵזֶר</bdbheb>). — On Naz. see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 13:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,5)\">Judg 13:5</ref></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Amos 2:11\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,11)\">Amos 2:11</ref></sup></lookup>, especially Grill<sup>JPTh. 1880, 645-680</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now<sup>Archaeology ii, § 97</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz<sup>Archaeology 429 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gray')\">Gray<sup>JThs. Jan. 1900, 201 ff.</sup></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> = <highlight>untrimmed vine</highlight> (like Nazirite with unshorn hair) <ref ref=\"Lev 25:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,5)\">Lev 25:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 25:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,11)\">Lev 25:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 49:26", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Num 6:2", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 6, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Lev 25:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 25, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Amos 2:11", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Amos 2:12", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Lev 25:11", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 25, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Lam 4:7", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Lam 49:26", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 49, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Deut 33:16", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 33, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Judg 13:5", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 13, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Judg 13:7", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 13, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Judg 16:17", "bo